  "structure": {
    "block_count": 63,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Come One, Come All to a Fun-Filled, Carnival-Themed Birthday Party",
        "text_sha256": "21de16ded183011fc8044f50c80217cba7e96c3b6db01cfc3dec04b161d53457",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "carnival birthday party",
        "text_sha256": "04f05939bae614d7e88e36c11e47a2a38c42ba2ee847f5465d1ab915049a6f2b",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Step right up and lean into this whimsical party theme.",
        "text_sha256": "807332307a38889a33b6341bf2580977c10ce3f3d98730cfd2c60136255ebdfe",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "From the rides and games to the iconic eats and treats, carnivals are a delight for fun-lovers of all ages, which is why a carnival-themed birthday party for your baby or toddler is a guaranteed good time for all.",
        "text_sha256": "410cd1fc3a2b522c25e5954fa572edcc14ce78cdd49020b0af8606c4eff9e823",
        "word_count": 39
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "\"A carnival-themed birthday party is a fun, whimsical and playful way to celebrate your little one,\" says Kat Robson, an experienced party planner and owner of Coastline Events in Long Island, New York.",
        "text_sha256": "4f1078291954add557b70094c0d0d56ebdbcf5a9bbd27c492428e2dbace69688",
        "word_count": 33
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Read on for professional advice on how to plan a birthday party that'll leave everyone in smiles and how to make the most of this unique birthday theme .",
        "text_sha256": "ef3f4b17c0b3e152e9e344c5b25fea494294a9bd118ca77c1b08efc44caf0d67",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Carnival birthday party invitations",
        "text_sha256": "c054e29981ecbebfdf0552450eaff370372852868d5a20c51c07fb4fabc49833",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Send big top-inspired invites",
        "text_sha256": "b773e03164c7896db05ee89ba219aec4064d4df1e211b1d999264bf59f46841b",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "carnival birthday party invitations",
        "text_sha256": "6f213efc76d0eb8ae197c464fac36ff2e8ac71d16abb7a1e8d161943461b04ea",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Drum up some drama and get guests excited about your little one's upcoming birthday with circus tent-inspired invites. Incorporating red and white stripes — plus a few banners, balloons or circus animals — will help get your theme across. You could even include a few carnival tickets in the envelope to add to the fun!",
        "text_sha256": "ab26bb4f4c22d9d8f0fad2b2d1a34f52e85c11bc8980be61a3ab82ceca519e27",
        "word_count": 55
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Carnival birthday party decor",
        "text_sha256": "9b872d68ea32be61d3dc36c7868e20ed0e97849d93a2adaa393e68758866d84d",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Establish the theme with the perfect color palette",
        "text_sha256": "d300a1ccc92d5bf132c5d177647667713230f4fcc83beca5e2e68f9412b82cb5",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "carnival birthday party color scheme",
        "text_sha256": "ab6a0dcd958cd1e5b721433ccccfd9ff94059d057f5c2718c8fa72832332789b",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "\"Keep the color palette simple and bright,\" Robson advises. \"For a carnival-themed birthday party, go with primary colors like red, yellow and blue — all of which you can use in various shades, such as a more golden yellow and even a turquoise blue,\" she explains.",
        "text_sha256": "3f6d731ee4e238d6b5ecbbd4d37243071bec4eb689a575226d519d0c202a7970",
        "word_count": 46
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you'd like a softer palette, \"Try gold, white and different shades of pink, like baby pink or hot pink,\" says Carolina Reyes, a professional event planner and founder of HTX Urban Events in Houston, Texas.",
        "text_sha256": "1dd4bc35a2ddbb2ba94595dae7108c8a9e4edd46b66c91438b9b6ac16fc30ccc",
        "word_count": 36
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Include stripes throughout your decor",
        "text_sha256": "a371b8686d608975672f1ee0e0364579e1b68a53e3ba4af3ba715d39aaf967f5",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "carnival birthday party striped backdrops",
        "text_sha256": "1b9136e7560b73b167d4ba8910268b08ddb7a0f290f20dbc5c0fc686af896b5b",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "\"Circus tent-inspired stripes are a must for any carnival-themed birthday party,\" Robson says. \"Recreate that look for a backdrop.\" For example, you could hang red and white striped tablecloths behind the buffet table.",
        "text_sha256": "ffec5f0814ce133f2af4e5533c04a7e6be81fd6b1928e7e279a06db354905cd5",
        "word_count": 33
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Bring your carnival-themed birthday party to life with props",
        "text_sha256": "4cd7bbff2bf945d4497ccc0089025b1a5ebe770f7c227592c2365e89531e5c13",
        "word_count": 9
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Help your theme come alive with larger-than-life decor. \"A giant popcorn box overflowing with 'popcorn' made out of balloons or life-sized animal props to use for photo ops are guaranteed to bring your party to the next level,\" Reyes says.",
        "text_sha256": "c530658a5fc4ce473c10c5c0542b95278547c04ca7909dbb917b404a03c2006e",
        "word_count": 40
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Carnival birthday party food",
        "text_sha256": "6562eb309586ebef42795f97aa15d49d5bd207e1bf32e96d487a95fd847b20b4",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Serve an array of carnival-themed eats",
        "text_sha256": "a73eb52ab6dddd8ef332eb82981d8ed400c4c151b3c06d8bfaabacd2e4481743",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
        "block_index": 22,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "carnival birthday party food",
        "text_sha256": "04899110c717aa8911ea5f2410e6da549cc066f96d83e571d714063f1c1513a2",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000023",
        "block_index": 23,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "\"For the main meal, serve typical carnival foods, such as hot pretzels, corn dogs or hot dogs, fries and roasted corn,\" Robson suggests — things even the pickiest eaters will likely enjoy! \"Sticking with the theme, you could even rent a popcorn or cotton candy machine where you can make fresh carnival snacks to serve guests.\"",
        "text_sha256": "71856833fc4975ce6866beafb3412e60b2a298a86339497ab0fe48d9f5c593ea",
        "word_count": 56
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000024",
        "block_index": 24,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Get your cake in on the theme",
        "text_sha256": "d29a9249b27a3991a7d69fb69f6ed6ff916f721ad06176bbeee1f1ff3347ff75",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000025",
        "block_index": 25,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "carnival birthday party cake",
        "text_sha256": "ac759111cac6c7d0f4c1f591d1dc204b9b3515a30418e0a7373e84469a2d11dd",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000026",
        "block_index": 26,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "\"Two-to-three-layer cakes work best for a carnival-theme birthday party, especially when one of the layers resembles a red-and-white-striped tent with banners or balloons adorning it,\" says Reyes. (If you're having a first birthday party, you can remove the top layer and use it as a smash cake for your little one.)",
        "text_sha256": "9968699648bf0cd018e0a813da422d5642e1996eec7f3e74c748f40830ba7a04",
        "word_count": 51
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000027",
        "block_index": 27,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Serve donuts that double as decor",
        "text_sha256": "fb53859c980c5753c7ff24d7e2959cb2585aaed2db93a707f448e425ac93f76e",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000028",
        "block_index": 28,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "carnival birthday party donuts",
        "text_sha256": "cd60eccaffd5a29dfa8b1db896070eac4b1ed044448bd4a7436e7183f260baf9",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000029",
        "block_index": 29,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "\"One of my favorite tips is to serve donuts instead of a cake!\" says Robson. \"Donut walls are a fun yet colorful way to have a sweet, tasty treat double as party decor.\" Add a sign that says \"concessions\" above to play up the circus theme.",
        "text_sha256": "f402e90a087047c12f39f90ce4ac1a9ed886d7c9535ce3d476ca31ea943026f4",
        "word_count": 46
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000030",
        "block_index": 30,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Carnival birthday party games",
        "text_sha256": "c6195a20971ae470c90e4d494c110806e32254a3695bcb3b00a5b34318e7b4b5",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000031",
        "block_index": 31,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Delight partygoers with an array of carnival games",
        "text_sha256": "a499979a09da9cdf66c58cbae68de22db2f4a2484ba4b030162b5167cad7410b",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000032",
        "block_index": 32,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "carnival birthday party games",
        "text_sha256": "4f951fde26441621ead53aec005beb62bf1b688a036877a582e20d91a5a558c6",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000033",
        "block_index": 33,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Entertain guests by setting up a few different carnival-themed activities around your event, suggests Robson: \"You can have a ring or bean bag toss game, a 'pop the balloon' game, a face painting station or a crafty activity for kids.\" Provide adult supervision — especially for games that require popping balloons or throwing things — and follow these party safety tips for little ones.",
        "text_sha256": "a1e32bea403a29e64623bee25881972fd26725580cbcacd5a3d12ee8cdb8d507",
        "word_count": 64
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000034",
        "block_index": 34,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Throw in some extra entertainment",
        "text_sha256": "8b83b360da0b617489770d29cfe14b98d747d1abb9efcfe5d7735aa461160b9e",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000035",
        "block_index": 35,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Nothing says carnival quite like a bounce house! \"There are big bounce houses that look like carnival tents you can rent, or you could hire a combination face painting and balloon artist to get two activities in one,\" suggests Reyes.",
        "text_sha256": "029061275a7d7cbdebb37042e911773bf5c8a2fa7bb636462a62599881a62f66",
        "word_count": 40
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000036",
        "block_index": 36,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you don't want to host your carnival-themed birthday party at home, \"You could host it at a petting zoo and even include pony rides, which are a huge hit with kids,\" says Reyes.",
        "text_sha256": "778d4628a13ce4ff955a5f9b077e17db775b48a5964798fc15c9c2faa2d33c49",
        "word_count": 34
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000037",
        "block_index": 37,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Carnival birthday party favors",
        "text_sha256": "0fc449f30cf1f962981695b66dc5c90bcd22a8c6197c51b919721269ea85e25f",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000038",
        "block_index": 38,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Let guests bring the entertainment home",
        "text_sha256": "0392bcda76d958146f358da6afe13a09ac477ae0b9c1ec67dc24855f1f30a43a",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000039",
        "block_index": 39,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "\"An interactive party favor that you can send your guests home with is a picture from a caricature artist,\" says Reyes. \"This is a fun activity that both parents and children will enjoy — plus it's a keepsake they can keep for years to come!\"",
        "text_sha256": "38a6c9f9df2cf85d4c9ec07a1afaf31d3e8c1e91864905a08f9da2e977aa7eac",
        "word_count": 45
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000040",
        "block_index": 40,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Send them off with a sweet thanks",
        "text_sha256": "da5e016ad5b1c2f76afaaeb9a13b3ce09b399503509295acb70f127f677c11cd",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000041",
        "block_index": 41,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "carnival birthday party favors",
        "text_sha256": "8a5a2b870342a7f7fa9898210d9ac04c7ce24f0ee1f0e1132495de5cf1e1df61",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000042",
        "block_index": 42,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Alternatively, send guests home with something sweet. \"A candy table — stocked with items like cotton candy or animal crackers — is a great way to display bright, colorful treats,\" says Robson. \"Let guests choose what they want from the assortment and bring them home in custom carnival-themed goodie bags ,\" she adds. \"It's a great thank you everyone can enjoy!\"",
        "text_sha256": "899a58cc362872f218472fcb02b6a9a26c929309b4cb4a6dd512101b0450e93d",
        "word_count": 61
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000043",
        "block_index": 43,
        "block_type": "blockquote",
        "tag": "blockquote",
        "text": "Carolina Reyes, Event Planner and Founder of HTX Urban Events , Houston, TX. Kat Robson, Party Planner and Owner of Coastline Events , Long Island, NY. WhatToExpect.com, How to Plan a First Birthday Party , November 2022. WhatToExpect.com, Unique First Birthday Party Ideas and Themes , January 2022. WhatToExpect.com, Toddler Birthday Party Dos and Don'ts , November 2022.",
        "text_sha256": "b034dd3e263cc4e59732a89aee86e70a6d54e22b3621c23233b390856248dc25",
        "word_count": 58
      },
